          "role": "definition",
          "latex": "\\hat{f}(\\omega) = \\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} f(t)e^{-i\\omega t}\\,dt",
          "cas": "Eq(f_hat(omega), Integral(f(t) * exp(-I * omega * t), (t, -oo, oo)))"
